      a narr:Sample ;
      dct:title "Team Process: Velociraptor Retro Format" ;
      dct:description "Meeting note in which Engineering Manager Sage Brightwell announces adoption of the Velociraptor retro format (Sailed / Stalled / Capsized), replacing the prior start-stop-continue format." ;
